{
  "about": "The libraries whose own test suites run here: each at a release, fetched from its own repository at the commit that release was made from, and run as its own CI runs it. Runtimes are the newest its CI ran at that release, where that can still be installed. 'pdfkiln' is the version PDFKiln's README names for the seven it lists.",
